          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Effects" typeId="fe13-6bab-c5cb-4f1d">Any ships with the Mark of Slaanesh may take and be obscured by a Veil of Lust. Ship firing on this vessel using the gunnery table suffers a right-column shift before any other modifiers are applied.</characteristic>
